          'pipeline:\n  processors:\n    - mapping: |\n        root = this\n        # Try ISO 8601 first\n        root.parsed_time = this.time.parse_timestamp("2006-01-02T15:04:05Z").catch(\n          # Fallback to Unix epoch\n          this.time.number().timestamp_unix().catch(\n            # Fallback to custom format\n            this.time.parse_timestamp("02/01/2006 15:04")\n          )\n        )\n',
